[["page","lines",0],{"text":"Page 5 of 10Loo et al. BMC Health Services Research (2022) 22:683","fontSize":8,"x":56.692901611,"y":31.332613769999966,"width":481.89060107399996,"height":8.516967773000033}]
[["page","lines",1],{"text":"to align with TRIP objectives and adopt the program","fontSize":9.8,"x":56.692901611,"y":372.64778710999997,"width":233.84563999625644,"height":9.800000000000011}]
[["page","lines",2],{"text":"without significant barriers. In addition to clinical buy-in,","fontSize":9.8,"x":56.692901611,"y":384.64298711,"width":233.83485999999996,"height":9.800000000000011}]
[["page","lines",3],{"text":"many participants noted that several activities included","fontSize":9.8,"x":56.692901611,"y":396.63818711,"width":233.86230000000026,"height":9.800000000000011}]
[["page","lines",4],{"text":"within the TRIP navigation protocol aligned with their","fontSize":9.8,"x":56.692901611,"y":408.63338711,"width":233.87405998876918,"height":9.800000000000011}]
[["page","lines",5],{"text":"on-going patient navigation work.","fontSize":9.8,"x":56.692901611,"y":420.62858711,"width":138.35640000000004,"height":9.800000000000011}]
[["page","lines",6],{"text":"“I don’t think that what [patients are] getting","fontSize":9.8,"x":68.03150161100001,"y":438.87618711,"width":211.1831400149548,"height":9.800000000000011}]
[["page","lines",7],{"text":"through TRIP is that different from what they got","fontSize":9.8,"x":68.03150161100001,"y":450.87138711,"width":211.19882000000013,"height":9.800000000000011}]
[["page","lines",8],{"text":"before. I think that it may be more streamlined... [b]","fontSize":9.8,"x":68.03150161100001,"y":462.86658711,"width":211.18803999251298,"height":9.800000000000011}]
[["page","lines",9],{"text":"ut I don’t think philosophically the program is that","fontSize":9.8,"x":68.03150161100001,"y":474.86178711,"width":211.15962000000007,"height":9.800000000000011}]
[["page","lines",10],{"text":"different.” Patient Navigator Supervisor (PNS)","fontSize":9.8,"x":68.03150161100001,"y":486.85698711000003,"width":183.6892399962564,"height":9.800000000000011}]
[["page","lines",11],{"text":"“[T]hey have been easy to follow because they’re","fontSize":9.8,"x":68.03150161100001,"y":498.85218711000005,"width":211.1762799887693,"height":9.800000000000011}]
[["page","lines",12],{"text":"similar to what we would do for our patients who","fontSize":9.8,"x":68.03150161100001,"y":510.84738711000006,"width":211.18019999999984,"height":9.800000000000011}]
[["page","lines",13],{"text":"are not part of TRIP or who we don’t use the TRIP","fontSize":9.8,"x":68.03150161100001,"y":522.8425871100001,"width":211.2125399925128,"height":9.799999999999955}]
[["page","lines",14],{"text":"guidelines for.” Patient Navigator (PN)","fontSize":9.8,"x":68.03150161100001,"y":534.8377871100001,"width":152.64479999999998,"height":9.799999999999955}]
[["page","lines",15],{"text":"“I think [TRIP is] doing what’s standard care. I think","fontSize":9.8,"x":68.03150161100001,"y":546.8329871100001,"width":211.18803999625658,"height":9.800000000000068}]
[["page","lines",16],{"text":"how they’ve done the study [by] collecting informa-","fontSize":9.8,"x":68.03150161100001,"y":558.82818711,"width":211.18110273400004,"height":9.800000000000068}]
[["page","lines",17],{"text":"tion from the patients or the patient navigator is","fontSize":9.8,"x":68.03150177,"y":570.8978023689999,"width":211.16060000000002,"height":9.800000000000068}]
[["page","lines",18],{"text":"what’s the standard of care at the hospital.” CC","fontSize":9.8,"x":68.03150177,"y":582.893002369,"width":187.82581999251272,"height":9.799999999999955}]
[["page","lines",19],{"text":"In some cases, the TRIP program aligned with on-going","fontSize":9.8,"x":64.68970177,"y":601.140602369,"width":225.8586399962564,"height":9.799999999999955}]
[["page","lines",20],{"text":"plans for the expansion of patient navigation services at","fontSize":9.8,"x":56.69290177,"y":613.135802369,"width":233.85250001494518,"height":9.800000000000068}]
[["page","lines",21],{"text":"a clinical site, whether that was an intentional structure","fontSize":9.8,"x":56.69290177,"y":625.131002369,"width":233.87602000374358,"height":9.799999999999955}]
[["page","lines",22],{"text":"to assess patients’ unmet social needs or expanding pro-","fontSize":9.8,"x":56.69290177,"y":637.126202369,"width":233.85841014399995,"height":9.800000000000068}]
[["page","lines",23],{"text":"gram services to different patient populations:","fontSize":9.8,"x":56.692901611,"y":649.1476955569999,"width":187.7160599962564,"height":9.800000000000068}]
[["page","lines",24],{"text":"“I think in many ways, TRIP is trying to achieve","fontSize":9.8,"x":68.03150161100001,"y":667.3952955569999,"width":211.1694199962564,"height":9.800000000000068}]
[["page","lines",25],{"text":"what I’ve tried to achieve, which is ... be mindful of","fontSize":9.8,"x":68.03150161100001,"y":679.390495557,"width":211.19000000000005,"height":9.799999999999955}]
[["page","lines",26],{"text":"the challenges that patients face as they go through","fontSize":9.8,"x":68.03150161100001,"y":691.385695557,"width":211.14981999625655,"height":9.799999999999955}]
[["page","lines",27],{"text":"the diagnosis and treatment of breast cancer, and","fontSize":9.8,"x":68.03150161100001,"y":703.380895557,"width":211.20861999251287,"height":9.799999999999955}]
[["page","lines",28],{"text":"incorporate in, at each of those junctures, a thought-","fontSize":9.8,"x":316.05970161100004,"y":372.630895557,"width":211.18442738900012,"height":9.800000000000011}]
[["page","lines",29],{"text":"ful appraisal of the social determinants of health,","fontSize":9.8,"x":316.062988281,"y":384.64778710999997,"width":211.1792199962564,"height":9.800000000000011}]
[["page","lines",30],{"text":"thinking about what are the specific challenges that","fontSize":9.8,"x":316.062988281,"y":396.64298711,"width":211.17921999999987,"height":9.800000000000011}]
[["page","lines",31],{"text":"specific patient may be experiencing, and then find","fontSize":9.8,"x":316.062988281,"y":408.63818711,"width":211.19783999625668,"height":9.800000000000011}]
[["page","lines",32],{"text":"solutions to make the journey a little bit easier.” PNS","fontSize":9.8,"x":316.062988281,"y":420.63338711,"width":208.96441999625608,"height":9.800000000000011}]
[["page","lines",33],{"text":"“[TRIP] places more of an emphasis on the social","fontSize":9.8,"x":316.062988281,"y":432.62858711,"width":211.16843999251307,"height":9.800000000000011}]
[["page","lines",34],{"text":"determinants, in thinking about care beyond the","fontSize":9.8,"x":316.062988281,"y":444.62378711,"width":211.18705999625638,"height":9.800000000000011}]
[["page","lines",35],{"text":"scope of the immediate treatment that they’re receiv-","fontSize":9.8,"x":316.062988281,"y":456.61898711000003,"width":211.18114071900015,"height":9.800000000000011}]
[["page","lines",36],{"text":"ing. You get a better understanding of the individual","fontSize":9.8,"x":316.062988281,"y":468.64778710999997,"width":211.15961999625642,"height":9.800000000000011}]
[["page","lines",37],{"text":"and their circumstances, and I think that enables me","fontSize":9.8,"x":316.062988281,"y":480.64298711,"width":211.16059999999982,"height":9.800000000000011}]
[["page","lines",38],{"text":"as an advocator to better support the patients that I","fontSize":9.8,"x":316.062988281,"y":492.63818711,"width":211.18412,"height":9.800000000000011}]
[["page","lines",39],{"text":"work with.” PN","fontSize":9.8,"x":316.062988281,"y":504.63338711,"width":58.62163999625648,"height":9.800000000000011}]
[["page","lines",40],{"text":"Considering barriers related to the Goals/Purpose con-","fontSize":9.8,"x":312.721188281,"y":522.88098711,"width":225.8616177730001,"height":9.799999999999955}]
[["page","lines",41],{"text":"struct, one clinical site noted that the majority of breast","fontSize":9.8,"x":304.724395751,"y":534.8978023689999,"width":233.8368200037438,"height":9.800000000000068}]
[["page","lines",42],{"text":"cancer patients served did not align with the targeted","fontSize":9.8,"x":304.724395751,"y":546.893002369,"width":233.86524000000009,"height":9.799999999999955}]
[["page","lines",43],{"text":"patient population of the TRIP program. This resulted in","fontSize":9.8,"x":304.724395751,"y":558.888202369,"width":233.85446000000024,"height":9.799999999999955}]
[["page","lines",44],{"text":"difficulties in enrolling TRIP patients at this institution,","fontSize":9.8,"x":304.724395751,"y":570.883402369,"width":233.8652400000002,"height":9.800000000000068}]
[["page","lines",45],{"text":"which was perceived as a misalignment of the TRIP pro-","fontSize":9.8,"x":304.724395751,"y":582.878602369,"width":233.85841030300003,"height":9.800000000000068}]
[["page","lines",46],{"text":"gram’s goals regarding who the intervention was attempt-","fontSize":9.8,"x":304.724395751,"y":594.8976955569999,"width":233.85841030300014,"height":9.800000000000068}]
[["page","lines",47],{"text":"ing to reach.","fontSize":9.8,"x":304.724395751,"y":606.8976955569999,"width":50.449419999999975,"height":9.800000000000068}]
[["page","lines",48],{"text":"“We see a lot of patients who are other types of","fontSize":9.8,"x":316.06299575099996,"y":625.1452955569999,"width":211.20861999999994,"height":9.800000000000068}]
[["page","lines",49],{"text":"minorities. TRIP was really focusing a lot on black","fontSize":9.8,"x":316.06299575099996,"y":637.140495557,"width":211.2056799887692,"height":9.799999999999955}]
[["page","lines",50],{"text":"patients, which we see proportionately fewer at [clin-","fontSize":9.8,"x":316.06299575099996,"y":649.135695557,"width":211.1811332490002,"height":9.800000000000068}]
[["page","lines",51],{"text":"ical site]. So since TRIP has started, I don’t think our","fontSize":9.8,"x":316.062988281,"y":661.1477031869999,"width":211.21841999625667,"height":9.800000000000068}]
[["page","lines",52],{"text":"demographics have changed all too much, but we’re","fontSize":9.8,"x":316.062988281,"y":673.142903187,"width":211.18803999251293,"height":9.799999999999955}]
[["page","lines",53],{"text":"hoping to make some progress here.” CC","fontSize":9.8,"x":316.062988281,"y":685.138103187,"width":158.1524000000001,"height":9.800000000000068}]
